  78:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (@) These API's (HAL_UART_Init(), HAL_HalfDuplex_Init(), HAL_LIN_Init(), HAL_MultiProcessor_Ini
  79:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****         also configure the low level Hardware GPIO, CLOCK, CORTEX...etc) by
  80:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****         calling the customized HAL_UART_MspInit() API.
  81:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  82:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     ##### Callback registration #####
  83:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     ==================================
  84:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  85:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  86:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
  87:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
  88:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  89:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  90:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     Use Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
  91:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
  92:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
  93:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
  94:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
  95:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
  96:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
  97:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
  98:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
  99:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
 100:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) WakeupCallback            : Wakeup Callback.
 101:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
 102:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
 103:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
 104:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
 105:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 106:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
 107:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 108:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 109:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     Use function HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 110:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     weak (surcharged) function.
 111:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 112:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     and the Callback ID.
 113:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 114:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
 115:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 116:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 117:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 118:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 119:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 120:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
 121:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
 122:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) WakeupCallback            : Wakeup Callback.
 123:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
 124:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
 125:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
 126:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
